# title: Korean brands and products | 브랜드
# category: brand
# source: Manufacturer and retailer sites and product histories. Launch years are the commonly cited launch dates. Notes flag brands that were founded in Korea but are now foreign-owned, or foreign-born but Korean-owned. Editorial selection; inclusion is not an endorsement.
